story  twists but  i don't remember the last time where i  saw something and went okay overall vibe  for it seems to be this and i was wrong  the last time i remember that happening  was the first wonder woman which  i was convinced was going to suck  and it didn't  i like it a lot  and i want that to happen with the  batman but the only way for it to happen  for me at this point is if all the  marketing has been misleading which  would in turn be its own problem  because if the marketing is accurate  which at this point given the  consistency of every single piece of  concept art poster every trailer etc  is very consistently hitting the exact  same note  i have a hard time believing that this  isn't exactly what they're selling me  and what they're selling me  is something that isn't  fun  and i don't  jive with the idea  that fun makes something  less worthy  less  meaningful less adult what  what is it that makes some people think  that being an adult means never having  fun  i don't know  but whatever it is that gets people into  that mindset  i'm not there and i don't ever want to  be  i want fun  i like batman  i would like a fun batman movie  because it's been a long time  since i've been looking forward  to really almost anything  batman related  because it's not fun anymore  it can be  the pieces are there  being fun is not a fundamental betrayal  of who batman is as a property or as a  character  they've just been treating it like it is  for way too dang long  just kind of had to get that off my  chest  i'm sure tons of people are going to  disagree with me  if the reaction to my  uh general sense of i'm not so sure  about this when i did a reaction to the  batman trailer if if the rest must have  any indication i'm about to get shredded  in the comments by a certain  group of fans but  uh we'll see  even if you think i'm 100 off base and  absolutely wrong please just don't be  rude  because i don't actually just delete  comments that disagree with me i just  delete ones that are rude and mean and  use personal attacks or threats  those i delete so don't do that your  comment will stay there even if you  disagree with me so whatever your  thoughts are as long as you can be not  rude about it drop something down in the  comments and let's talk about it  like share subscribe if you don't hate  me after this ramble you can support me  on patreon link in the description as  well as well as the other stuff that i  do no real pressure though  because at the end of the day  agree with me or not you are actually  the council  i'm just running the meetings  so until next time this council is  adjourned  [Music]  patreon shout outs thank you to turok  shane ross oliver b melinda walters  robin powell for nobulax the poodle  edelon tracy scrabbit dharma michael  doyle vincent paul bartolucci angry  casper adam lefty taylor robin moore  shayla gourley and bookworm  you can support me as well hear me  mispronounce your name  sure i got some of those wrong  [Music]  [Music]  now  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

